          "ordering_spec": "Use data/manual/body_mount_order_release_specs.csv lines BM-HW-001 to BM-HW-005 and BM-SHIM-001 to BM-SHIM-002. Sleeves are Toyota 90560-12009 style spacers: length 48.1 mm, M10 clearance ID if made locally, OD copied from old/OE sample, and 18.0 mm rubber bore target.",
          "material_spec": "Steel tube, cup washers, shims, and structural fasteners; zinc plated, epoxy primed, or painted after cutting; class-marked bolts only",
